<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13514] Apache Ignite Slim edition builds without config/default-config.xml</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13514</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In Apache Ignite Slim Edition ignite.sh doesn&apos;t work from the box since file &lt;tt&gt;config/default-config.xml&lt;/tt&gt; is absent.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Root cause: config file is edition dependent, see assembly/release-base.xml:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;         &amp;lt;fileSet&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;directory&amp;gt;config/${ignite.edition}&amp;lt;/directory&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;outputDirectory&amp;gt;/config&amp;lt;/outputDirectory&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/fileSet&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
